---
import IconArrowRight from './icons/IconArrowRight.astro';
import IconShield from './icons/IconShield.astro';
import IconCheck from './icons/IconCheck.astro';
---

<section id="contacto" class="py-24 px-6 lg:px-10 max-w-[1240px] mx-auto border-t border-[#EAEAE4] dark:border-white/10">
  <div class="rounded-3xl border border-[#EAEAE4] dark:border-white/10 bg-white dark:bg-[#0E0E12] p-8 sm:p-12 lg:p-16 shadow-lg dark:shadow-2xl">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-start">
      
      <!-- Columna Izquierda: Mensaje Cercano y Humano -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-6">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#E58B72] dark:bg-red-500 animate-pulse"></span>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-[#8A3D28] dark:text-red-400 font-semibold">07 // Contacto Directo</span>
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-[#252A29] dark:text-white tracking-tight leading-[1.15]">
          Empecemos a construir <br />
          <span class="text-[#8A3D28] dark:text-red-400">tu ventaja digital.</span>
        </h2>

        <p class="text-base text-[#252A29]/80 dark:text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed max-w-md">
          Conversá directamente con nosotros. Analizamos la situación de tu negocio y te decimos con honestidad si necesitás una web de alto rendimiento, un flujo de automatización o ambos.
        </p>

        <!-- Garantías de Atención -->
        <div class="space-y-3 pt-6 border-t border-[#EAEAE4] dark:border-white/10 text-xs font-medium text-[#252A29]/80 dark:text-neutral-300">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
            <IconCheck class="w-4 h-4 text-[#8A3D28] dark:text-red-500 shrink-0" />
            <span>Presupuesto claro y cerrado, sin costos adicionales.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
            <IconCheck class="w-4 h-4 text-[#8A3D28] dark:text-red-500 shrink-0" />
            <span>Código 100% de tu propiedad. Sin ataduras ni mensualidades cautivas.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
            <IconCheck class="w-4 h-4 text-[#8A3D28] dark:text-red-500 shrink-0" />
            <span>Respuesta en menos de 2 horas hábiles vía WhatsApp o correo.</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-4 flex items-center gap-4 text-xs font-mono text-[#252A29]/60 dark:text-neutral-400">
          <span>Ubicación: <strong>Buenos Aires, Argentina</strong></span>
          <span>·</span>
          <span>Atención a toda la región</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Columna Derecha: Formulario Minimalista y Elegante -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 bg-[#F8F8F5] dark:bg-neutral-950 p-7 sm:p-9 rounded-2xl border border-[#EAEAE4] dark:border-white/10 shadow-sm">
        <form class="space-y-4" onsubmit="event.preventDefault();">
          
          <div>
            <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-[#252A29] dark:text-neutral-200 uppercase tracking-wide mb-1.5">
              Tu Nombre o Nombre de la Empresa
            </label>
            <input 
              type="text" 
              required
              placeholder="Ej. Estudio Rossi / Café Bistro" 
              class="w-full px-4 py-3 bg-white dark:bg-neutral-900 border border-[#EAEAE4] dark:border-white/10 rounded-xl text-sm text-[#252A29] dark:text-white placeholder-[#252A29]/40 dark:placeholder-neutral-500 focus:outline-none focus:border-[#8A3D28] dark:focus:border-red-500 transition-colors"
            />
          </div>

          <div>
            <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-[#252A29] dark:text-neutral-200 uppercase tracking-wide mb-1.5">
              Rubro o Tipo de Negocio
            </label>
            <select class="w-full px-4 py-3 bg-white dark:bg-neutral-900 border border-[#EAEAE4] dark:border-white/10 rounded-xl text-sm text-[#252A29] dark:text-white focus:outline-none focus:border-[#8A3D28] dark:focus:border-red-500 transition-colors">
              <option value="comercio">Comercio Local / Gastronomía</option>
              <option value="juridico">Estudio Jurídico o Contable</option>
              <option value="ecommerce">Tienda Online / E-commerce</option>
              <option value="ia">Automatización de Procesos con IA</option>
              <option value="otro">Otro proyecto a medida</option>
            </select>
          </div>

          <div>
            <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-[#252A29] dark:text-neutral-200 uppercase tracking-wide mb-1.5">
              WhatsApp o Teléfono de Contacto
            </label>
            <input 
              type="tel" 
              required
              placeholder="+54 9 11 ..." 
              class="w-full px-4 py-3 bg-white dark:bg-neutral-900 border border-[#EAEAE4] dark:border-white/10 rounded-xl text-sm text-[#252A29] dark:text-white placeholder-[#252A29]/40 dark:placeholder-neutral-500 focus:outline-none focus:border-[#8A3D28] dark:focus:border-red-500 transition-colors"
            />
          </div>

          <div>
            <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-[#252A29] dark:text-neutral-200 uppercase tracking-wide mb-1.5">
              ¿Qué problema buscas resolver? (Opcional)
            </label>
            <textarea 
              rows="3" 
              placeholder="Ej. Necesito un menú QR que no cobre comisiones / Queremos filtrar consultas de clientes..." 
              class="w-full px-4 py-3 bg-white dark:bg-neutral-900 border border-[#EAEAE4] dark:border-white/10 rounded-xl text-sm text-[#252A29] dark:text-white placeholder-[#252A29]/40 dark:placeholder-neutral-500 focus:outline-none focus:border-[#8A3D28] dark:focus:border-red-500 transition-colors resize-none"
            ></textarea>
          </div>

          <button 
            type="submit" 
            class="w-full py-4 px-6 rounded-full bg-[#8A3D28] dark:bg-red-600 hover:bg-[#6E2E1C] dark:hover:bg-red-500 text-white text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide transition-all duration-200 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg dark:shadow-[0_0_20px_-3px_rgba(239,68,68,0.5)] group cursor-pointer"
          >
            <span>Solicitar Diagnóstico Sin Costo</span>
            <IconArrowRight class="w-4 h-4 text-white group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-transform" />
          </button>

          <p class="text-[11px] font-mono text-center text-[#252A29]/60 dark:text-neutral-400 pt-1">
            Sin spam. Te responderemos directamente por WhatsApp con ideas y cotización.
          </p>

        </form>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
